/* ============================================================
   HARDENING — MILESTONE 3: revisions replace the dirty boolean
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   cloudPush() called markDirty(false) on any success. An edit made
   while a push was in flight was therefore marked clean by the
   completion of a request that never contained it, and was lost on
   the next device that pulled. A push may now only mark a track
   clean if the local state has not advanced since that request's
   payload was built.
