           boot/login/pull use to tell "I'm simply ahead" from "we diverged".
           Recorded here, on the clean commit, not via a timer: the push is
           async, so anything polling immediately after the call still sees
           the pre-flight dirty state and would never record agreement. */
        syncFpSet(syncFingerprint(payload()));
