/* ============================================================
   HARDENING — MILESTONE 4: protect dirty local data on
   login, boot and pull
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   Reconciliation compared only the newest weigh-in/day key, which
   cannot see an independent change: a GLP-1 dose, a symptom, a
   settings change, a workout correction, a historical note, a skip,
   a routine edit. Any of those could be silently replaced by the
